category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libcurl-devel
sdesc: "Small Footprint CIM Client library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "SFCC is a CIM client for C that can directly access SFCB. You can
use SFCC to CIM-enable your programs. It will work with any CIMOM
that supports CIM-XML; however, SFCB can take advantage of the
LocalConnect interface for improved performance (no XML
encoding/decoding overhead)."
skip:

homepage: https://sourceforge.net/projects/sblim/
license: EPL-1.0
